{"title":"Why Aren’t Modernist Bridges Awful?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/967969436/0/marginalrevolution~Why-Arent-Modernist-Bridges-Awful.html","date":1787051853000,"content":"<p>The public dislikes modern architecture but, generally speaking, they do not dislike modern bridges. Lists of the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://luxatic.com/top-20-awesome-bridges-world/\">most awesome</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.businessinsider.com/25-stunning-bridges-to-see-in-your-lifetime-2016-7\">most stunning</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.cntraveller.com/gallery/beautiful-bridges-in-the-world\">most beautiful</a> bridges in the world will mention classics like London’s Tower Bridge, the Brooklyn Bridge, or the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.atlasobscura.com/places/rakotzbrucke-devils-bridge\">Rakotzbrücke</a> but alongside them they will picture the Kubitschek Bridge in Brazil (Shutterstock).\r\n<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-bridge.avif\" width=\"889\" height=\"667\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-bridge.avif 889w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-bridge-300x225.avif 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-bridge-768x576.avif 768w\" />The Rio-Antirrio Bridge in Greece:\r\n<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge.jpg\" alt=\"Rio-Antirrio Bridge\" width=\"2987\" height=\"2175\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge.jpg 2987w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge-300x218.jpg 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge-1024x746.jpg 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge-768x559.jpg 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge-1536x1118.jpg 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rio-Antirio_bridge-2048x1491.jpg 2048w\" />or the Moses “Bridge” in the Netherlands.\r\n<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Digital_Eye–2015–Mosess_Bridge_at_Fort_de_Roovere-1.jpg\" alt=\"Moses Bridge\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Digital_Eye–2015–Mosess_Bridge_at_Fort_de_Roovere-1.jpg 1280w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Digital_Eye–2015–Mosess_Bridge_at_Fort_de_Roovere-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Digital_Eye–2015–Mosess_Bridge_at_Fort_de_Roovere-1-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Digital_Eye–2015–Mosess_Bridge_at_Fort_de_Roovere-1-768x512.jpg 768w\" />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you like these bridges or not, I don’t see in the literature an idea that modern bridges are all ugly or that modern bridge building has failed or fallen behind the great bridges of the past in the way that there is such a critique for modern architecture in general.</p>\r\n<p>Why is this? I have a theory, which is that bridge designers come from engineering schools rather than schools of architecture. It is possible, of course, that there is something in the nature of bridges that prunes the design space in a way that attracts beauty–maybe we like catenaries, arches, cables in tension and beauty is just a byproduct of the engineering.</p>\r\n<p>It is possible, however, to produce <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.sfgate.com/local/editorspicks/article/embarcadero-freeway-san-francisco-photos-history-15990662.php\">ugly bridges</a> so it’s not just an engineering constraint. Moreover, one small but telling piece of evidence in favor of my theory is that most of the bridges chosen by <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wallpaper.com/architecture/amazing-bridge-architecture-around-the-globe\">Wallpaper magazine,</a> an architecture magazine specifically, are in fact ugly (and with no overlap in the bridges from my first category of “popular” beautiful bridges). Here are a few, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wallpaper.com/architecture/amazing-bridge-architecture-around-the-globe\">judge for yourself</a>:</p>\r\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper3.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"707\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper3.webp 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper3-300x207.webp 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper3-768x530.webp 768w\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper2.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper2.webp 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper2-300x200.webp 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper2-768x512.webp 768w\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper1.webp\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper1.webp 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper1-300x200.webp 300w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Wallpaper1-768x512.webp 768w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The fact that modern bridges are often beautiful, especially when they come from engineers, is consistent with <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://worksinprogress.co/issue/the-beauty-of-concrete/\">Samuel Hughes’s argument</a> that ugly has been a choice, not a constraint.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/why-arent-modernist-bridges-awful.html\">Why Aren’t Modernist Bridges Awful?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/967969436/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/967969436/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/967969436/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2026%2f08%2fK-bridge.avif\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/967969436/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/967969436/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/967969436/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/why-arent-modernist-bridges-awful.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/why-arent-modernist-bridges-awful.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/why-arent-modernist-bridges-awful.html#comments\"><h3>Comm